        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.44,
          "end": 101.03999999999999,
          "en": "this is where we will later add our other components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.03999999999999,
          "end": 104.85,
          "en": "Typically, we might have a webpage like this with a header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.85,
          "end": 108.66,
          "en": "with home and users than a main area and a sidebar, maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.66,
          "end": 110.1,
          "en": "Now if we have a look,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.1,
          "end": 113.07,
          "en": "this would be a fitting component, the header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.07,
          "end": 115.89,
          "en": "and maybe also the items on the header",
